{"attribution":"Federal Emergency Management Agency, Ready.gov, Home Fires, Simplified Chinese; no FEMA, DHS, or U.S. Government endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-001","input":"火灾可能会在短短两分钟内危及生命，而火焰在五分钟内就能吞没一座住宅。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-002","input":"不到 30 秒，小火就能变成大火。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-003","input":"浓浓的黑烟只需几分钟就能充满房屋或被火焰吞没。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-004","input":"热量比火焰更具威胁性。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-005","input":"火焰中的楼面室温可达 100 度，但在眼睛的高度处能升到 600 度。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-006","input":"吸入这种超热空气会烧焦肺部，让衣服融化在皮肤上。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-007","input":"火焰开始很亮，但很快就会产生黑烟和完全黑暗。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-008","input":"烟雾和毒气比火焰造成的死亡人数更多。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-009","input":"火焰会产生毒气，使人迷失方向和昏昏欲睡。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-010","input":"有效的烟雾报警器能显着增加在致命家中火灾中幸存的机会。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-011","input":"除非用 10 年有效期的锂电池，每年都要换两次电池。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-012","input":"在家中每一层都要安装烟雾报警器，包括地下室。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-013","input":"每 10 年或根据制造商说明更换整个烟雾报警器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-014","input":"烹饪时切勿停用烟雾报警器，因为可能致命。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-015","input":"视障者可用听觉警报器，听障者可用带振动垫或闪光灯的烟雾警报器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-016","input":"制作有价值文件和记录（如出生证）的数字副本。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-017","input":"如已投保，联系保险公司获取详细说明，了解如何保护财产、进行盘点和联系火灾损失复原公司。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-018","input":"切记：发生火灾时，每一秒都很重要。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-019","input":"逃生计划有助于快速离家。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-020","input":"每年都要两次练习家中火灾逃生计划。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"如果主要通道被火焰或烟雾挡住，要找两种离开每个房间的方法。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"确保窗户不会卡住，纱窗能快速取下，安全栏能正确打开。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-023","input":"练习在黑暗中或闭着眼睛摸索走出家门。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-023","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-024","input":"教导孩子不要躲避消防员。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-024","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-025","input":"如用助行器或轮椅，检查所有出口，确保通道通畅。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-025","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-026","input":"睡觉时关上卧室门。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-026","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"在厨房放一个灭火器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-028","input":"联系当地消防部门，获取有关正确使用和维护的协助。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-028","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-029","input":"考虑在住房安装自动喷水灭火系统。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-030","input":"如有任何烟雾，趴在地板上，在低处爬到出口。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-031","input":"浓烟和毒气会先沿着天花板聚集。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-031","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-032","input":"开门前先摸门把手和门。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-033","input":"如果其中一个很热，或门周围有烟出来，不要开门，用第二条出路。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-033","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-034","input":"如果出现浓烟或火灾，准备好迅速关门。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-035","input":"告诉急救人员此人所在地方。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-035","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-036","input":"如有宠物困在家中，立即告诉消防员。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-036","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-037","input":"如果出不去，关上门，用布或胶带盖住门周围的通风口和裂缝，以防烟雾进入。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-037","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-038","input":"说出所在地方，用浅色布或手电筒在窗口发出求救信号。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-038","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-039","input":"如果衣服着火，停下、趴下和滚动：立即停下，趴在地上，用手盖住脸部。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-039","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-040","input":"不断前后左右滚动，直到扑灭火焰。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-040","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-041","input":"如果自己或他人无法停下、趴下和滚动，用毯子或毛巾扑灭火焰。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-041","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-042","input":"立即用冷水治疗烧伤 3 到 5 分钟。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-042","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-043","input":"用干净的干布盖住。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-043","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-044","input":"如需临时住所、食物和药品，联系当地救灾服务机构（如红十字会）。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-044","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-045","input":"与消防部门核实，确保住所可以安全进入。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-045","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-046","input":"切勿自己尝试重新连接公用设施。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-046","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-047","input":"在离开现场之前，消防部门应确保公用设施可安全使用或断开连接。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-047","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-048","input":"清点损坏的财产和物品。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-048","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-049","input":"清点物品之前，切勿丢弃任何损坏的物品。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-049","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-050","input":"先放好任何火灾损失费用相关收据。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-050","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-051","input":"保险公司以后可能需要这些收据，核实所得税索赔损失也可能需要。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-051","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-052","input":"将火灾告诉房贷公司。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-052","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-053","input":"家中火灾可以预防。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-053","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-054","input":"人人都可采取下列简单步骤来防止悲剧发生。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-054","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-055","input":"煎炸或烧烤食物时，不要离开厨房。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-055","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-056","input":"如要离开，即使是很短的时间，也要关掉炉子。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-056","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-057","input":"烹饪时要穿短袖、紧身袖或卷紧的袖子。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-057","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-058","input":"将烤肉架放在离壁板和露台栏杆至少 10 英尺的地方，远离屋檐和悬垂的树枝。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-058","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-059","input":"磨损的电线会引起火灾。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-059","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-060","input":"立即更换所有磨损、陈旧或损坏的电器电源线，不要将电源线放在地毯或家具下面。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-060","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-061","input":"如果电器有三孔插头，则只能在三槽插座中使用。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-061","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-062","input":"切勿强行插入双槽插座或延长线。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-062","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-063","input":"如果电灯开关发热且灯在闪烁，立即关闭，然后聘请专业人士更换。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-063","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-064","input":"晚上或离开家时关掉节日装饰灯。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-064","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-065","input":"更换磨损或破损的任何灯串电线或松动的灯泡连接。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-065","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-066","input":"使蜡烛与易燃材料保持至少 12 英寸的距离，或考虑使用无焰蜡烛。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-066","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-067","input":"每天给圣诞树浇水，不要让它干涸。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-067","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-068","input":"干燥的树更易燃。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-068","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-069","input":"确保你的树离任何热源至少三英尺远，例如壁炉、散热器、蜡烛、热通风口或灯，并且不阻塞出口。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-069","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-070","input":"不要使延长线和插座超载。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-070","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-071","input":"每年检查和清洁柴炉管道和烟囱，每月检查是否有损坏或阻塞。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-071","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-072","input":"使用足够重的壁炉屏风，阻止滚动的柴火，要大到足以覆盖壁炉的整个开口才能挡住飞溅的火花。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-072","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-073","input":"外出或睡觉之前，务必将火完全熄灭。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-073","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-074","input":"在可燃物体与便携式加热设备之间保持至少 3 英尺的距离。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-074","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-075","input":"只买国家认可实验室评估过的加热器，例如，美国保险商实验室 (UL)。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-075","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-076","input":"确保便携式加热器有恒温器控制机制，倒地时会自动关闭。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-076","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-077","input":"在煤油加热器中只用晶莹剔透的 K-1 煤油。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-077","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-078","input":"如用加热器，房间通风要好，并远离窗帘和其他易燃物品。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-078","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-079","input":"告诉孩子，火是一种工具，不是玩具，让孩子明白为什么不能玩火。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-079","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-080","input":"将火柴和打火机放在孩子够不到也看不见的地方，最好放在上锁的柜子里。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-080","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-081","input":"即使时间很短，也不要让孩子无人看管靠近在用的火炉或燃烧的蜡烛。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-081","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-082","input":"切勿使用燃气灶或烤箱为住房供暖。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-082","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-083","input":"这会增加火灾和烧伤的风险，并可能损坏电器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-083","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-084","input":"使用燃气炉作为热源尤其危险，因为一氧化碳会积聚起来并达到一个危险水平，使您和家人面临一氧化碳中毒的危险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-084","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-085","input":"让可燃和易燃液体远离热源。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-085","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-086","input":"切勿在室内使用便携式发电机，而且只应在室外和通风良好的地方加油。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-086","split":"article"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese paragraph and list-item sentences from the checksum-pinned Ready.gov main element, removed navigation, images, external resources, phone/URL instructions, page furniture, and exact duplicates, and added input-only provenance; no expected text or converter output was used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"article":86},"eligible_pending_review":86,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":86},"upstream_revision":"Ready.gov Simplified Chinese Home Fires; page last updated 2025-10-31; retrieved HTML SHA-256: 42142f589d716969cb5aca13c9b7d3dd3e521cc87faa4556c2690648cbb83ff7","version":1}
